        You will be given the root cause of a bug, the commit message and the corresponding patch.
        You need to extract all code statements that lead to the bug from the patch, based on the root cause and the commit message.

        Root cause:
        The bug was caused by an incomplete reset of the interrupt handling mechanism, specifically related to the breadcrumbs interface. The previous implementation did not properly manage the auxiliary timers and IRQ states, which could lead to incorrect behavior during the reset path, resulting in incomplete requests and potential hangs in the graphics processing.

        Commit message:
        drm/i915: Reset the breadcrumbs IRQ more carefully

